{"start": 0.0, "end": 15.0, "text": " The serpent queen's mark. Where is she?"}
{"start": 20.0, "end": 22.0, "text": " I swore I would never tell."}
{"start": 30.0, "end": 35.0, "text": " The serpent queen's mark."}
{"start": 45.0, "end": 47.0, "text": " Home before dark jamsab."}
{"start": 49.0, "end": 53.0, "text": " With honey this time, I promise."}
{"start": 60.0, "end": 65.0, "text": " I will not let you go."}
{"start": 77.0, "end": 79.0, "text": " Leave the weeds honey paste."}
{"start": 80.0, "end": 83.0, "text": " Weed here, Verstum. Honey only sweetens."}
{"start": 91.0, "end": 97.0, "text": " Wild honey."}
{"start": 98.0, "end": 100.0, "text": " A whole cave of it."}
{"start": 120.0, "end": 127.0, "text": " Your lighter down you go."}
{"start": 133.0, "end": 136.0, "text": " Hold it tight, Rastum."}
{"start": 150.0, "end": 155.0, "text": " It's full."}
{"start": 180.0, "end": 187.0, "text": " Honey sells for silver friend."}
{"start": 188.0, "end": 193.0, "text": " Rostum."}
{"start": 211.0, "end": 213.0, "text": " Mother."}
{"start": 214.0, "end": 217.0, "text": " I'm so sorry."}
{"start": 226.0, "end": 231.0, "text": " A rockfall man and he's gone."}
{"start": 231.0, "end": 236.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 237.0, "end": 240.0, "text": " No. Not my son."}
{"start": 261.0, "end": 271.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 287.0, "end": 289.0, "text": " Show me the way then."}
{"start": 291.0, "end": 294.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 313.0, "end": 316.0, "text": " What is this place?"}
{"start": 321.0, "end": 326.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 344.0, "end": 346.0, "text": " You came down my bees well."}
{"start": 347.0, "end": 349.0, "text": " I fell. I mean no harm."}
{"start": 351.0, "end": 356.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 365.0, "end": 369.0, "text": " Time, sage and fear."}
{"start": 372.0, "end": 376.0, "text": " Rast, no one hurts you here."}
{"start": 381.0, "end": 386.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 398.0, "end": 403.0, "text": " Silver leaf. For cuts and for poison."}
{"start": 411.0, "end": 418.0, "text": " Name it."}
{"start": 423.0, "end": 424.0, "text": " Mint."}
{"start": 441.0, "end": 447.0, "text": " My mother thinks I'm gone."}
{"start": 449.0, "end": 452.0, "text": " The mountain door opens and spring."}
{"start": 471.0, "end": 476.0, "text": " Why did the snakes obey you?"}
{"start": 478.0, "end": 482.0, "text": " They don't obey. They listen."}
{"start": 482.0, "end": 487.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 496.0, "end": 500.0, "text": " I believe my heart cures every illness."}
{"start": 501.0, "end": 503.0, "text": " Does it?"}
{"start": 512.0, "end": 517.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 543.0, "end": 546.0, "text": " Again. I win again."}
{"start": 548.0, "end": 550.0, "text": " You cheat with your tail."}
{"start": 563.0, "end": 565.0, "text": " The last man I trusted."}
{"start": 565.0, "end": 567.0, "text": " Brought hunters."}
{"start": 569.0, "end": 571.0, "text": " I'm not him."}
{"start": 572.0, "end": 576.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 587.0, "end": 588.0, "text": " Name it."}
{"start": 598.0, "end": 600.0, "text": " Black root."}
{"start": 600.0, "end": 602.0, "text": " A slow poison."}
{"start": 631.0, "end": 633.0, "text": " Name them."}
{"start": 634.0, "end": 638.0, "text": " Silver leaf. Water mint."}
{"start": 638.0, "end": 640.0, "text": " Wild time."}
{"start": 655.0, "end": 659.0, "text": " Spring. The door is open."}
{"start": 660.0, "end": 663.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 666.0, "end": 670.0, "text": " Come with me. Meet my mother."}
{"start": 679.0, "end": 682.0, "text": " I swear you'll never tell where I live."}
{"start": 685.0, "end": 687.0, "text": " I swear it."}
{"start": 688.0, "end": 691.0, "text": " On my mother's life."}
{"start": 711.0, "end": 714.0, "text": " So my snakes will always know you."}
{"start": 715.0, "end": 718.0, "text": " Hide them from men."}
{"start": 735.0, "end": 737.0, "text": " Name it."}
{"start": 737.0, "end": 740.0, "text": " Time. For a heavy heart."}
{"start": 745.0, "end": 748.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 757.0, "end": 762.0, "text": " Gem, sir. My son. You're alive."}
{"start": 763.0, "end": 767.0, "text": " I'm home, mother. I'm home."}
{"start": 775.0, "end": 778.0, "text": " I'm home."}
{"start": 778.0, "end": 781.0, "text": " A whole year. Where were you?"}
{"start": 783.0, "end": 786.0, "text": " Somewhere, kind. I can't say more."}
{"start": 786.0, "end": 789.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 801.0, "end": 804.0, "text": " You took the rope, Bristan."}
{"start": 807.0, "end": 810.0, "text": " I thought the rocks took you."}
{"start": 816.0, "end": 820.0, "text": " Water mint. Drink it hot."}
{"start": 847.0, "end": 849.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 851.0, "end": 853.0, "text": " I'm sorry."}
{"start": 876.0, "end": 894.0, "text": " You're medicine, majesty. Drink."}
{"start": 895.0, "end": 898.0, "text": " Your medicine, majesty. Drink."}
{"start": 898.0, "end": 906.0, "text": " It tastes of ashes are done."}
{"start": 919.0, "end": 922.0, "text": " The physicians have failed our king."}
{"start": 929.0, "end": 934.0, "text": " The serpent queen's heart. Cures all."}
{"start": 946.0, "end": 950.0, "text": " Gold? For whoever brings her to me."}
{"start": 950.0, "end": 951.0, "text": " Oh!"}
{"start": 958.0, "end": 961.0, "text": " Her friends carry her scales."}
{"start": 981.0, "end": 984.0, "text": " Her man. Scales on his hands."}
{"start": 1000.0, "end": 1003.0, "text": " Take me to him a dawn."}
{"start": 1011.0, "end": 1014.0, "text": " Mother, stay inside."}
{"start": 1028.0, "end": 1029.0, "text": " Bring him."}
{"start": 1040.0, "end": 1055.0, "text": " Your king is dying out of man."}
{"start": 1066.0, "end": 1069.0, "text": " Your king is dying out of man."}
{"start": 1071.0, "end": 1074.0, "text": " Then let me heal him."}
{"start": 1092.0, "end": 1094.0, "text": " Tell me if I do not."}
{"start": 1095.0, "end": 1097.0, "text": " Or your mother pays."}
{"start": 1098.0, "end": 1100.0, "text": " Leave her alone."}
{"start": 1118.0, "end": 1120.0, "text": " My mother."}
{"start": 1120.0, "end": 1122.0, "text": " How can I choose?"}
{"start": 1127.0, "end": 1132.0, "text": " Tell her. Tell her not to come."}
{"start": 1157.0, "end": 1162.0, "text": " She kept his word."}
{"start": 1166.0, "end": 1169.0, "text": " Now I keep mine."}
{"start": 1182.0, "end": 1185.0, "text": " Take it. Hide in the hills."}
{"start": 1188.0, "end": 1194.0, "text": " Keep your silver."}
{"start": 1195.0, "end": 1197.0, "text": " Bring back my son."}
{"start": 1217.0, "end": 1231.0, "text": " Don, her man. Speak."}
{"start": 1238.0, "end": 1241.0, "text": " Saddle the horses. The village."}
{"start": 1278.0, "end": 1283.0, "text": " No. You shouldn't have come."}
{"start": 1286.0, "end": 1290.0, "text": " You kept your oath. Now I'm here."}
{"start": 1290.0, "end": 1305.0, "text": " God!"}
{"start": 1306.0, "end": 1307.0, "text": " Caesar."}
{"start": 1307.0, "end": 1322.0, "text": " Release him. Then take me to your king."}
{"start": 1338.0, "end": 1341.0, "text": " This is no illness."}
{"start": 1345.0, "end": 1346.0, "text": " Name it."}
{"start": 1360.0, "end": 1363.0, "text": " Black fruit. A slow poison."}
{"start": 1364.0, "end": 1369.0, "text": " Lies. The herb man lies."}
{"start": 1369.0, "end": 1374.0, "text": " The herb man lies."}
{"start": 1392.0, "end": 1395.0, "text": " In a sleeve he carries it."}
{"start": 1399.0, "end": 1404.0, "text": " The herb man lies."}
{"start": 1407.0, "end": 1409.0, "text": " Silver leaf for the poison."}
{"start": 1410.0, "end": 1412.0, "text": " Honey to soften it."}
{"start": 1418.0, "end": 1421.0, "text": " Slowly majesty. Slowly."}
{"start": 1429.0, "end": 1434.0, "text": " You are real."}
{"start": 1436.0, "end": 1441.0, "text": " Real enough to save a king."}
{"start": 1452.0, "end": 1455.0, "text": " You poisoned your king for a throne."}
{"start": 1456.0, "end": 1462.0, "text": " For her heart to live forever."}
{"start": 1469.0, "end": 1472.0, "text": " Take him far beyond my mountains."}
{"start": 1485.0, "end": 1488.0, "text": " Stay."}
{"start": 1489.0, "end": 1494.0, "text": " Be honored in my palace."}
{"start": 1499.0, "end": 1502.0, "text": " My home is under the mountain."}
{"start": 1515.0, "end": 1525.0, "text": " You came back again."}
{"start": 1526.0, "end": 1529.0, "text": " I always come back mother."}
{"start": 1529.0, "end": 1534.0, "text": " You are my mother."}
{"start": 1544.0, "end": 1546.0, "text": " Will the door open next spring?"}
{"start": 1547.0, "end": 1550.0, "text": " Not anymore. Men know now."}
{"start": 1559.0, "end": 1565.0, "text": " I don't know this one."}
{"start": 1590.0, "end": 1593.0, "text": " Forget me not. For remembering."}
{"start": 1604.0, "end": 1605.0, "text": " I'll remember."}
{"start": 1620.0, "end": 1622.0, "text": " I'll remember."}
{"start": 1629.0, "end": 1630.0, "text": " Name it."}
{"start": 1649.0, "end": 1652.0, "text": " Still there."}
{"start": 1679.0, "end": 1681.0, "text": " I'll remember."}